        "TileImage": "$($repository 271755c3-3278-4fde-9cdd-6a8a28bfc079).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. A major maritime insurance syndicate wishes to terminate the legendary cat burglar, Kalvin Ritter. However, eliminating &quot;The Sparrow&quot; is only half the job. Intel suggests that two key security assets on board-Sebastian Godfrey and Michael Carter-are actively assisting Ritter in smuggling stolen artwork. \rTo make this look like an accident, eliminate the inside men using their professional uniforms, and ensure Ritter takes his final, fatal plunge over the railing. Good luck.",
